e: \'test\'  ...# Subtest: game survives first 3 seconds without any player inputok 27 - game survives first 3 seconds without any player input  ---  duration_ms: 18.100221  type: \'test\'  ...# Subtest: Z\303\272bok fires CEREC dental laser that damages and defeats enemiesok 28 - Z\303\272bok fires CEREC dental laser that damages and defeats enemies  ---  duration_ms: 3.964768  type: \'test\'  ...# Subtest: Sign\303\241lik tag-swap fires Exolon twin Wi-Fi waves that trap enemies in Bubble Bobble bubbleok 29 - Sign\303\241lik tag-swap fires Exolon twin Wi-Fi waves that trap enemies in Bubble Bobble bubble  ---  duration_ms: 1.933655  type: \'test\'  ...# Subtest: Saboteur ninja dash grants speed burst, afterimage, and cooldownok 30 - Saboteur ninja dash grants speed burst, afterimage, and cooldown  ---  duration_ms: 2.265589  type: \'test\'  ...# Subtest: Dizzy/Towdie stage relic awards bonus points, heals wounded player, and logs chronicleok 31 - Dizzy/Towdie stage relic awards bonus points, heals wounded player, and logs chronicle  ---  duration_ms: 2.813458  type: \'test\'  ...# Subtest: restoring all objectives triggers stage_clear and advances to next stageok 32 - restoring all objectives triggers stage_clear and advances to next stage  ---  duration_ms: 4.291366  type: \'test\'  ...# Subtest: defeat is reachable when player loses all 3 vitality heartsok 33 - defeat is reachable when player loses all 3 vitality hearts  ---  duration_ms: 2.048449  type: \'test\'  ...# Subtest: Melodik AY jukebox provides 4 distinct valid 3-channel chiptune tracksok 34 - Melodik AY jukebox provides 4 distinct valid 3-channel chiptune tracks  ---  duration_ms: 2.575121  type: \'test\'  ...# Subtest: selectTrackForStage maps Rimavsk\303\241 Sobota stages and boss fight to appropriate Melodik tracksok 35 - selectTrackForStage maps Rimavsk\303\241 Sobota stages and boss fight to appropriate Melodik tracks  ---  duration_ms: 0.597306  type: \'test\'  ...# Subtest: Checkpoint continue 