  checkpoint {
    session_summary: "<summary>\n## 1. Task Overview\n- **Project**: \342\200\236Z\303\272bok a sign\303\241lik\342\200\234 (Vite + React + TypeScript, 256\303\227192 ZX Spectrum / Didaktik M retro arcade-adventure & magnetic cassette `.BAS`/`.TAP`/`.WAV` generator), a personal Christmas gift for **Rado Cegl\303\251dy** from citizens of the Rimavsk\303\241 Sobota region (microDENT.sk & TeatrO.eu).\n- **User Prompt Scope**: Audit, complete, polish, and verify Tasks 1\342\200\2235 plus critical feedback items (Part 1 & Part 2):\n  - **\303\232loha 1**: Stage 6 Finale Boss \342\200\236Ve\304\276k\303\275 Ru\305\241i\304\215\342\200\234 (F1 shield via 8 targets, F2 3 caries weak spots vulnerable only to Z\303\272bok laser, F3 bubble trap via Sign\303\241lik wave + pop, F4 boss bursts & drops mandatory MVP plaque -> carry to podium -> 256\303\227192 `handover` cutscene with growing pixel portrait, typewriter dedication from `src/data/dedication.ts`, ZX confetti, fanfare, ENTER -> `victory` modal).\n  - **\303\232loha 2**: Authentic 6912 B `SCREEN$` (`src/didaktik/zxScreen.ts`, 4\303\2274 Bayer ordered dithering, interlaced addressing, 8\303\2278 attribute clash using `computeZxAttributeByte`), offscreen canvas composer (`zxScreenCompose.ts`), `buildDeluxeTapFile` (6 blocks: Loader `ZUBOK&SIG` -> Bytes `ZUBOK` 6912 B @ 16384 -> Game BASIC), `parseTap`, `decodeWavToBlocks` ROM edge-timing round-trip decoder, skippable web cassette loading intro (red/cyan -> blue/yellow stripes, 3 thirds reveal), ZX-quantized 24\303\22724 in-game portrait.\n  - **\303\232loha 3**: 6 distinct stages (Stage 1 UV beams 2s on/2s off + 0.5s telegraph; Stage 2 rotating CBCT beam dodgeable with Shift dash; Stage 3 Atomix ordered fiber targets 1\342\200\2237 resetting on wrong order without damage; Stage 4 Rimava river water `~` slowing to 50% with dry bridges; Stage 5 locked vault doors `D` unlocked by Kronika 1270 relic; Stage 6 Boss).\n  - **\303\232loha 4**: NPC citizens (`src/game/citizens.ts`, 1\342\200\2232 per stage, quotes \342\211\244 56 chars, 3s proximity speech), `src/data/signatures.ts` (used in handover scrolling credits, Chapter 06 printable 63\303\22788 mm collector card with `@page` 1:1 mm scale & secret code, and Deluxe cassette ending screen DATA lines via `sanitizeZxString`), deterministic 8-char secret code unlocking \342\200\236Tajn\303\241 miestnos\305\245 1270\342\200\234 via key `K` on title screen.\n  - **\303\232loha 5**: Stage checkpoint continue (-20% score penalty, `R` stays full restart, defensive `localStorage` persistence), Spectrum `POKE 48621,5 \342\200\223 RADO RE\305\275IM? A / N` prompt on 2nd loss in the same stage (+2 hearts = 5 max, 30% slower enemy bolts, HUD indicator), offline `file://` delivery (local bundled fonts via `@fontsource/*`, relative Vite `base: \'./\'`, bundled image imports), hygiene (`package.json` name, unused deps removed, Slovak `README.md`), Windows PowerShell-compatible `npm test`.\n  - **Bonus/Part 2 features already partially built in engine/audio**: 4-track Melodik AY-3-8912 background music & jukebox (`src/game/music.ts`, `src/game/audio.ts`), 2P local co-op (`coopEnabled`, `input.p2` in `src/game/engine.ts` & `renderer.ts`), printable 1:1 mm physical sheets (`@page`, cassette label / J-card / 3D box die-cut SVG).\n- **Deliverables at Completion**: Run `npm run lint`, `npm test`, `npm run build`, perform Ultra Mode visual browser verification via `playwright-cli`, and report changed files, test/build results, and manual verification checklist for a real Didaktik M (`LOAD \"\"` with both Deluxe and backup `.TAP`).\n\n## 2. Progress\n- **Skills Read**:\n  - `/skills/system_skills/ultra_mode/SKILL.md` (mandatory build, unit-test, browser inspect, critique & fix loop; max 2 rounds).\n  - `/skills/system_skills/computer_use/SKILL.md` (`playwright-cli` rules: use global binary, headless chromium, relative `.playwright-cli/` paths, always `trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT`, restart dev server after edits).\n  - Note: `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/SKILL.md` was marked relevant but not yet read; read if making major UI layout changes (only small surgical UI additions are planned).\n- **Files Inspected (No Edits Made Yet)**:\n  - `/package.json`, `/README.md`, `/scripts/run-tests.mjs`, `/index.html`, `/src/index.css`, `/src/main.tsx`, `/vite.config.ts`\n  - `/src/App.tsx`\n  - `/src/game/types.ts`, `/src/game/levels.ts`, `/src/game/engine.ts`, `/src/game/renderer.ts`, `/src/game/sprites.ts`, `/src/game/audio.ts`, `/src/game/citizens.ts`, `/src/game/music.ts`, `/src/game/progress.ts`\n  - `/src/didaktik/tapeBuilder.ts`, `/src/didaktik/basicSource.ts`, `/src/didaktik/specs.ts`, `/src/didaktik/zxScreen.ts`, `/src/didaktik/zxScreenCompose.ts`\n  - `/src/data/dedication.ts`, `/src/data/signatures.ts`\n  - `/src/components/BrandEmblems.tsx`, `/src/components/StatusModal.tsx`, `/src/components/TapeKitModal.tsx`, `/src/components/VisualManualModal.tsx`, `/src/components/GameHud.tsx`, `/src/components/TitleOverlay.tsx`, `/src/components/CassetteIntroOverlay.tsx`, `/src/components/SecretRoomModal.tsx`, `/src/components/AssetStudioPanels.tsx`\n  - Test files: `/src/didaktik/tapeBuilder.test.ts`, `/src/didaktik/zxScreen.test.ts`, `/src/game/boss.test.ts`, `/src/game/citizens.test.ts`, `/src/game/stages.test.ts`, `/src/game/progress.test.ts`, `/src/game/coop.test.ts`, `/src/game/music.test.ts`\n- **Baseline Verification Command Run**:\n  - `npm run lint && npm test` -> **EXITED 0** (0 TS errors; 45/45 unit tests passing across all test files via `node scripts/run-tests.mjs`).\n\n## 3. Key Findings\nMost of Tasks 1\342\200\2235 are already implemented in the repository, **but our deep audit uncovered specific bugs, typos, missing wiring, and unfulfilled details** that must be fixed/completed:\n\n1. **Slovak Grammar & Chronicle Strip Length Bugs**:\n   - `src/game/levels.ts:263`: `\'KRONIKA: 3D CBCT L\303\232\304\214 ROTUJE \302\267 PREBEHNI CEZ NEJ [SHIFT]!\'` has a gender typo (`l\303\272\304\215` is masculine -> should be `\'KRONIKA: 3D CBCT L\303\232\304\214 ROTUJE \302\267 PREBEHNI CEZE\305\207 [SHIFT]!\'`, 53 chars).\n   - `src/game/engine.ts:494`: `\'2P CO-OP: H1 Z\303\232BOK (WASD+SPACE) \302\267 H2 SIGN\303\201LIK (\305\240\303\215PKY+ENTER)\'` is **59 chars** (violates max 56-char rule for chronicle strip -> shorten to `\'2P CO-OP: H1 Z\303\232BOK (WASD) \302\267 H2 SIGN\303\201LIK (\305\240\303\215PKY+ENTER)\'`, 53 chars).\n   - `src/components/VisualManualModal.tsx:458`: `\'J-CARD \302\267 ZADNA STRANA KAZETY\'` is missing diacritic -> `\'J-CARD \302\267 ZADN\303\201 STRANA KAZETY\'`.\n   - `README.md:32`: incorrectly says `Loader (ZUBOKSCR)` while `tapeBuilder.ts:717` actually builds `\'ZUBOK&SIG\'` (per spec). Update `README.md` to say `ZUBOK&SIG` + `ZUBOK` (`SCREEN$`).\n\n2. **Deluxe Cassette Ending Screen Signatures (`DATA` lines are currently unreachable!)**:\n   - `src/data/signatures.ts` (`formatSignaturesAsBasicData`) appends `9100 REM ...` + `9110 DATA ...`, and `App.tsx` passes those as `extraDeluxeBasicLines` to `TapeKitModal` -> `buildDeluxeTapFile`.\n   - **HOWEVER**, `basicSource.ts` line `795` is `795 PAUSE 0: GOTO 30`, so the Didaktik M **never executes or displays** the citizen signatures on the ending screen!\n   - **Rule 1 constraint**: Must NOT alter `generateSinclairBasicLines`, `buildTapFile`, `encodeTapeToWav`, or `tokenizeBasicLine` output.\n   - **Fix**: Keep `generateSinclairBasicLines` and `buildTapFile` 100% untouched. In `formatSignaturesAsBasicData` (or in `buildDeluxeTapFile`), include a clean BASIC subroutine starting at line `9000` (e.g., `9000 RESTORE 9100: CLS: BORDER 1: PRINT AT 1,3; INK 6;\"KNIHA PODPISOV OBCANOV RS\": LET R=3`, `9010 READ N$: IF N$=\"END\" THEN PAUSE 0: GOTO 30`, `9020 PRINT AT R,2; INK 7;N$: LET R=R+1: IF R>20 THEN PAUSE 0: CLS: LET R=3`, `9030 GOTO 9010`) and inside `buildDeluxeTapFile` ONLY (when `extraBasicLines` contains a `9000 ` line), replace line `795` in `buildDeluxeTapFile`\'s local `gameLines` copy with `\'795 PAUSE 120: GOTO 9000\'`. Verify all 6 Deluxe blocks tokenize cleanly, pass `parseTap` XOR=0, and round-trip through `decodeWavToBlocks` under 150s!\n\n3. **Missing Informative `didaktik40` Test & Exact Cell Attribute Assertion (Task 2)**:\n   - Prompt requires: `round-trip p\303\264vodn\303\275ch AJ deluxe blokov cez WAV pre profil zx35 (didaktik40 iba informat\303\255vny test), celkov\303\241 d\304\272\305\276ka p\303\241sky < 150 s, adresovanie pixelov (0,0), (0,1), (0,8), (0,64), atrib\303\272t bunky`.\n   - `src/didaktik/zxScreen.test.ts` already tests `zx35` round-trip, `< 150 s`, and `(0,0),(0,1),(0,8),(0,64)`, plus bright bit on cell `(0,0)`, **but** add an explicit exact `computeZxAttributeByte` cell attribute check and an informative `didaktik40` WAV round-trip check (matching `didaktik40` clock vs `zx35` ROM mismatch behavior).\n\n4. **Unwired Existing Features (`src/App.tsx`, `GameHud.tsx`, `TitleOverlay.tsx`, `AssetStudioPanels.tsx`)**:\n   - **Melodik AY Background Music (`src/game/music.ts` + `audio.ts`)**: `audio.ts` has `startMusic`, `stopMusic`, `toggleMusic`, `playJukeboxTrack`, and `music.ts` has 4 complete tracks + `selectTrackForStage`, **but `App.tsx` never starts/stops music during gameplay** and `AssetStudioPanels.tsx` (`sfx` tab) has no Melodik AY Jukebox UI!\n     - Wire `App.tsx` to start/update `didaktikAudio.startMusic(selectTrackForStage(hud.stageIndex, hud.bossActive))` when `hud.phase === \'playing\'` and `!overlayOpen && !introVisible`, and `didaktikAudio.stopMusic()` when paused/title/handover/victory/gameover/modals open. Also stop music cleanly on unmount.\n     - Add a compact, non-cluttered **Melodik AY-3-8912 Jukebox (4 skladby)** strip inside `ChiptuneSfxPanel` (`src/components/AssetStudioPanels.tsx`) to play/stop the 4 tracks.\n   - **2P Local Co-op (`src/game/engine.ts` + `renderer.ts` + `coop.test.ts`)**: Engine and renderer already fully support 2P Co-op (P1 = Z\303\272bok `WASD + Space`, P2 = Sign\303\241lik `Arrows + Enter/RightShift`), **but `App.tsx` never populates `input.p2` and has no UI/key toggle**!\n     - Wire `App.tsx` with `coopEnabled` state / `handleToggleCoop` (key `Digit2` or clean compact `1P` / `2P CO-OP` button in `GameHud.tsx` and `TitleOverlay.tsx`):\n       - When `coopEnabled === false` (default 1P): keep exact current behavior (both WASD and Arrows control active hero, Space fires, C swaps).\n       - When `coopEnabled === true` (2P Co-op): P1 uses `WASD + Space` (LeftShift = dash), P2 uses `ArrowKeys + Enter / ShiftRight` (prevent default on Enter when playing in 2P co-op).\n\n5. **Print `@page` & Physical Edition 1:1 mm Sheets (Task 4b & Part 2 #4)**:\n   - `src/index.css` currently has `@media print` rules **without `@page`**. Add `@page { size: A4 portrait; margin: 10mm; }` and clean `break-inside: avoid` classes for the 63\303\22788 mm collector cards and cassette label/J-card so printing produces true 1:1 mm physical cuts.\n   - In `VisualManualModal.tsx` Chapter 02 (`fyzicka`): make the Cassette Label (102\303\22764 mm) and J-Card print-scaled cleanly with crop marks AND add a compact downloadable/printable **SVG 3D Box Die-Cut Blueprint (165\303\227225\303\22738 mm)** button (generates a real 1:1 mm architectural SVG with fold dashes and glue tabs for cutting/folding the collector box!).\n   - In `VisualManualModal.tsx` Chapter 05 (`plaketa`): already shows Rado portrait, Erb RS, and Secret Code; optionally add a compact Citizen Signatures footer note so the A4 certificate feels complete.\n\n6. **Portrait Path Note (`public/assets/rado.jpg` vs Vite bundled image)**:\n   - In this AI Studio container, `public/assets/rado.jpg` does NOT exist (`/public/assets/` only contains `aistudio/image_3bf278e7.png`). Default portrait is `/src/assets/images/rado_portrait_techno_1795115581925.jpg`, statically imported in `src/components/BrandEmblems.tsx` so Vite bundles it cleanly for both `http://` and offline `file://` builds (`base: \'./\'`). Do NOT replace this with a broken `/assets/rado.jpg` path; keep the working Vite import and note in the final summary how to swap the photo locally (`src/assets/images/` or upload button in Manual Ch. 05).\n\n7. **Canvas Palette Authenticity Audit**:\n   - Verified `src/game/sprites.ts` and `src/game/renderer.ts`: **0 hardcoded hex colors outside `ZX_PALETTE`** \342\200\224 every single canvas `fillStyle`/`strokeStyle` references `ZX_PALETTE.*` or `ZX_BORDER_COLORS`. Good!\n\n## 4. Errors & Fixes\n- No errors encountered yet. Initial `npm run lint && npm test` passed cleanly (45/45 tests, 0 TS errors).\n\n## 5. Active Context\n- Workspace root is `/app/applet` in shell, `/` in file tools.\n- Dev server runs on port 3000 with `DISABLE_HMR=true`; after code edits, must call `compile_applet` and `restart_dev_server` before running `playwright-cli` browser verification.\n- Zero code edits have been written yet; all inspection is complete.\n\n## 6. Next Steps\nExecute in strict order:\n\n1. **Fix Slovak typos, chronicle strip lengths, and README accuracy**:\n   - `src/game/levels.ts`: fix `CEZ NEJ` -> `CEZE\305\207` (line 263).\n   - `src/game/engine.ts`: shorten 2P co-op chronicle text to `<= 56` chars (line 494).\n   - `src/components/VisualManualModal.tsx`: fix `ZADNA` -> `ZADN\303\201` (line 458).\n   - `README.md`: fix `ZUBOKSCR` -> `ZUBOK&SIG`, document 2P Co-op (`2`), Melodik AY Jukebox, and SVG box die-cut export.\n\n2. **Make Deluxe Cassette Ending Screen actually display Citizen Signatures (`DATA` lines)** without touching `generateSinclairBasicLines` / `buildTapFile`:\n   - `src/data/signatures.ts`: extend `formatSignaturesAsBasicData` to prepend the `9000\342\200\2239030` `RESTORE 9100` / `READ N$` display routine before `9100 REM ...` + `DATA` lines (all pure sanitized ASCII, valid Sinclair BASIC).\n   - `src/didaktik/tapeBuilder.ts`: inside `buildDeluxeTapFile` ONLY, when `extraBasicLines` contains a line starting with `\'9000 \'`, swap line `795` in the local copy of `gameLines` to `\'795 PAUSE 120: GOTO 9000\'`.\n   - `src/didaktik/zxScreen.test.ts` & `src/game/citizens.test.ts`: add tests verifying: (a) Deluxe `.TAP` with signatures still passes `parseTap` (6 blocks, XOR=0), `< 150 s`, and `decodeWavToBlocks` (`zx35`); (b) exact `computeZxAttributeByte` cell attribute assertion; (c) informative `didaktik40` WAV round-trip test; (d) `buildTapFile` / `generateSinclairBasicLines` remain 100% unchanged.\n\n3. **Wire Melodik AY Music + Jukebox & 2P Local Co-op**:\n   - `src/App.tsx`:\n     - Start/update `didaktikAudio.startMusic(selectTrackForStage(hud.stageIndex, hud.bossActive))` during active `playing` phase (and stop when paused/title/handover/victory/gameover or modal/intro open).\n     - Add `coopEnabled` state + `handleToggleCoop` calling `toggleCoopMode(world)` (key `Digit2` when playing/title, plus button).\n     - Populate `input.p2` (`ArrowUp/Down/Left/Right` + `Enter`/`ShiftRight` fire) when `world.coopEnabled` is true, and split P1 movement to `WASD` + `Space` + `ShiftLeft` when in 2P Co-op (preserving full WASD+Arrows single-player controls when 1P).\n   - `src/components/GameHud.tsx` & `src/components/TitleOverlay.tsx`: add a clean compact `1P` / `2P CO-OP` toggle button (no clutter or overlap).\n   - `src/components/AssetStudioPanels.tsx`: add a clean 4-track **Melodik AY-3-8912 Jukebox** strip inside `ChiptuneSfxPanel` wired to `didaktikAudio.playJukeboxTrack(...)`.\n\n4. **Upgrade Printable Physical Edition (`@page` 1:1 mm + 3D Box SVG Die-Cut)**:\n   - `src/index.css`: add `@page { size: A4 portrait; margin: 10mm; }` and `.print-avoid-break { break-inside: avoid; page-break-inside: avoid; }`.\n   - `src/components/VisualManualModal.tsx`: add `print-avoid-break` to the 63\303\22788 mm cards and cassette label/J-card, add a **Stiahnu\305\245 vystrihova\304\215ku krabi\304\215ky .SVG (165\303\227225\303\22738 mm)** download button in Chapter 02 generating a real 1:1 mm architectural SVG net with fold lines and glue flaps, and ensure Chapter 06 card + Chapter 05 plaque print cleanly.\n\n5. **Run Verification & Tests**:\n   - Run `npm run lint && npm test` (must pass 100%, including new tests).\n   - Run `compile_applet`, then `restart_dev_server`.\n   - Run **Ultra Mode Browser Verification** (`playwright-cli` with `trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT` at `1440x900`):\n     - Verify cassette intro overlay -> skip -> title screen (`?autostart=1` and normal load), zero console/network errors.\n     - Verify gameplay canvas (`?autostart=1`), HUD (1P/2P toggle, Melodik AY, hearts, targets, stage title), movement & firing.\n     - Open Tape Kit modal (`T`): inspect Cassette tab (SCREEN$ preview, `didaktik40` warning alert, Deluxe + Backup buttons), SFX tab (Melodik AY Jukebox).\n     - Open Visual Manual (`V`): inspect Chapter 02 (Box SVG button), Chapter 05 (Plaque + Secret Code), Chapter 06 (63\303\22788 mm cards).\n     - Open Secret Room 1270 (`K` on title): verify invalid code rejection + valid code unlock.\n     - Critique screenshots, fix any visual/functional defects, and re-verify if needed (max 2 rounds).\n   - Final build & check: co-execute `compile_applet` and `lint_applet`, plus verify `npm test` and `npm run build` (and confirm `dist/index.html` uses relative `./` paths with zero external Google Fonts links).\n\n## 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- **NEPORU\305\240ITE\304\275N\303\211 PRAVIDL\303\201**:\n  1. Never alter the output of `buildTapFile`, `encodeTapeToWav`, `generateSinclairBasicLines`, or `tokenizeBasicLine`. All existing 45 tests must stay green. Default clock profile stays `zx35`; `didaktik40` shows exact text `Experiment\303\241lne \342\200\223 na skuto\304\215n\303\275 LOAD pou\305\276i zx35`.\n  2. Keep UI clean, non-overlapping, techno-futuristic + 8-bit. Canvas uses ONLY `ZX_PALETTE` colors.\n  3. Flawless Slovak diacritics in UI & canvas; strictly `sanitizeZxString` (no diacritics) in BASIC/cassette text; chronicle strips \342\211\244 56 chars.\n  4. Deterministic `node:test` unit tests for every new/changed pure mechanic; `npm test` works in Windows PowerShell (`node scripts/run-tests.mjs`).\n  5. Zero external runtime network dependencies (fonts & assets bundled locally for `file://`).\n- **Response Requirements**: Reply in clear, concise Slovak matching the user\'s request, listing changed files, `npm test` and `npm run build` outcomes, what was verified in the real browser, and the manual Didaktik M hardware checklist (`LOAD \"\"` for both Deluxe and backup `.TAP`).\n</summary>"
