  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Implementation Scope**\n\nI\'m now carefully reviewing the edits for the AY music integration, Jukebox feature, local co-op, and printable box components. Specifically, I\'m examining `/src/App.tsx` and focusing on the import of `selectTrackForStage` and `toggleCoop` and how they\'ve been incorporated. I want to make sure all these new features play together as expected.\n\n\n**Integrating New Inputs**\n\nI\'ve been working on new game controls. I\'ve added a P2 fire mechanism using a ref for Enter/ShiftRight, and created a `handleToggleCoop` callback. I\'ve integrated `useEffect` to manage music playback using `selectTrackForStage` with DidaktikAudio, starting music when the game phase is \'playing\' and stopping it under various conditions, including clean stops in the TapeKitModal. I\'m making sure all these recent changes mesh properly with the existing logic.\n\n\n**Refining Player Input**\n\nI\'m now refining player input for single and co-op modes, shifting P2\'s fire to ShiftRight, and implementing new WASD/Arrow key controls. When coop is off, input remains consistent. When enabled, P1 uses WASD+Space, and P2 Arrow Keys+ShiftRight. I\'ve updated the HUD, passing `world.coopEnabled` for an immediate UI change, and added a slick toggle.\n\n\n**Adding New Interface Features**\n\nI\'m now implementing the UI for co-op mode. I\'m adding a toggle in the title overlay with \"Re\305\276im: 1P (S\303\263lo) / 2P Co-op [2]\" below the existing buttons, and showing \"2 Co-op\" in the bottom control hint. I\'m also adding a Melodik AY-3-8912 Jukebox grid with 4 tracks to the AssetStudioPanels component.\n\n\n**Implementing Jukebox Integration**\n\nI\'m now integrating the Jukebox SFX section, making sure the track title, BPM, and Play/Stop button are all synced with `didaktikAudio.playJukeboxTrack(track.id)` and `activeTrackId`. I\'ve also confirmed that music is correctly stopped on modal close, so there\'s no need to handle this manually. Plus, the visual manual is getting polish with a fix for the J-CARD text and print optimizations. I\'m also adding a box die-cut blueprint SVG download.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "ZJH_arb9KNOxkdUP9NrC4Qg"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_3378483430953261434"
      name: "multi_replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"Description\":\"Wire Melodik AY stage background music and local 2P Co-op controls & state in App.tsx\", \"Instruction\":\"Import selectTrackForStage and toggleCoopMode, wire music playback effect, 2P Co-op input split & toggle, and pass props to TitleOverlay and GameHud\", \"ReplacementChunks\":[{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":29, \"ReplacementContent\":\"import {\\n  advanceHandoverToVictory,\\n  continueFromCheckpoint,\\n  createWorld,\\n  drainAudioQueue,\\n  getHudSnapshot,\\n  restartCurrentRun,\\n  setRadoPokeMode,\\n  startNewGame,\\n  stepWorld,\\n  swapActiveHero,\\n  toggleCoopMode,\\n} from \'./game/engine\';\\nimport { selectTrackForStage } from \'./game/music\';\\nimport { loadSavedProgress, saveProgress } from \'./game/progress\';\", \"StartLine\":15, \"TargetContent\":\"import {\\n  advanceHandoverToVictory,\\n  continueFromCheckpoint,\\n  createWorld,\\n  drainAudioQueue,\\n  getHudSnapshot,\\n  restartCurrentRun,\\n  setRadoPokeMode,\\n  startNewGame,\\n  stepWorld,\\n  swapActiveHero,\\n} from \'./game/engine\';\\nimport { loadSavedProgress, saveProgress } from \'./game/progress\';\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":87, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  const fireJustPressedRef = useRef(false);\\n  const p2FireJustPressedRef = useRef(false);\\n  const dashJustPressedRef = useRef(false);\\n  const swapJustPressedRef = useRef(false);\", \"StartLine\":82, \"TargetContent\":\"  const fireJustPressedRef = useRef(false);\\n  const dashJustPressedRef = useRef(false);\\n  const swapJustPressedRef = useRef(false);\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":186, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  const clearInputs = useCallback(() => {\\n    keysHeldRef.current.clear();\\n    fireJustPressedRef.current = false;\\n    p2FireJustPressedRef.current = false;\\n    dashJustPressedRef.current = false;\\n    swapJustPressedRef.current = false;\\n  }, []);\", \"StartLine\":180, \"TargetContent\":\"  const clearInputs = useCallback(() => {\\n    keysHeldRef.current.clear();\\n    fireJustPressedRef.current = false;\\n    dashJustPressedRef.current = false;\\n    swapJustPressedRef.current = false;\\n  }, []);\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":240, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  const handleSwapHero = useCallback(() => {\\n    const world = worldRef.current;\\n    if (!world || world.phase !== \'playing\') return;\\n    swapActiveHero(world);\\n    const events = drainAudioQueue(world);\\n    if (events.length > 0) didaktikAudio.playEvents(events);\\n    syncHudNow();\\n    canvasRef.current?.focus();\\n  }, [syncHudNow]);\\n\\n  const handleToggleCoop = useCallback(() => {\\n    const world = worldRef.current;\\n    if (!world) return;\\n    clearInputs();\\n    toggleCoopMode(world);\\n    didaktikAudio.playEvents([{ type: \'swapHero\' }]);\\n    syncHudNow();\\n    if (world.phase === \'playing\') {\\n      canvasRef.current?.focus();\\n    }\\n  }, [clearInputs, syncHudNow]);\", \"StartLine\":231, \"TargetContent\":\"  const handleSwapHero = useCallback(() => {\\n    const world = worldRef.current;\\n    if (!world || world.phase !== \'playing\') return;\\n    swapActiveHero(world);\\n    const events = drainAudioQueue(world);\\n    if (events.length > 0) didaktikAudio.playEvents(events);\\n    syncHudNow();\\n    canvasRef.current?.focus();\\n  }, [syncHudNow]);\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":316, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  const handleCloseTapeKit = useCallback(() => {\\n    setTapeKitOpen(false);\\n    didaktikAudio.stopCassetteSignal();\\n    didaktikAudio.stopMusic();\\n  }, []);\", \"StartLine\":312, \"TargetContent\":\"  const handleCloseTapeKit = useCallback(() => {\\n    setTapeKitOpen(false);\\n    didaktikAudio.stopCassetteSignal();\\n  }, []);\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":482, \"ReplacementContent\":\"      if (e.code === \'Digit2\' && !e.repeat && (world.phase === \'playing\' || world.phase === \'title\')) {\\n        e.preventDefault();\\n        handleToggleCoop();\\n        return;\\n      }\\n\\n      if (e.code === \'KeyC\' && !e.repeat && world.phase === \'playing\') {\\n        swapJustPressedRef.current = true;\\n        return;\\n      }\\n\\n      if (world.phase === \'playing\' && world.coopEnabled) {\\n        if (e.code === \'Enter\') {\\n          e.preventDefault();\\n          if (!keysHeldRef.current.has(\'Enter\')) {\\n            p2FireJustPressedRef.current = true;\\n          }\\n          keysHeldRef.current.add(\'Enter\');\\n          return;\\n        }\\n        if (e.code === \'ShiftRight\') {\\n          if (!keysHeldRef.current.has(\'ShiftRight\')) {\\n            p2FireJustPressedRef.current = true;\\n          }\\n          keysHeldRef.current.add(\'ShiftRight\');\\n          return;\\n        }\\n        if ((e.code === \'ShiftLeft\' || e.code === \'KeyX\') && !e.repeat) {\\n          dashJustPressedRef.current = true;\\n          return;\\n        }\\n      } else if (\\n        (e.code === \'ShiftLeft\' || e.code === \'ShiftRight\' || e.code === \'KeyX\') &&\\n        !e.repeat &&\\n        world.phase === \'playing\'\\n      ) {\\n        dashJustPressedRef.current = true;\\n        return;\\n      }\\n\\n      if (e.code === \'Space\' && !keysHeldRef.current.has(\'Space\')) {\\n        fireJustPressedRef.current = true;\\n      }\\n      keysHeldRef.current.add(e.code);\", \"StartLine\":464, \"TargetContent\":\"      if (e.code === \'KeyC\' && !e.repeat && world.phase === \'playing\') {\\n        swapJustPressedRef.current = true;\\n        return;\\n      }\\n\\n      if (\\n        (e.code === \'ShiftLeft\' || e.code === \'ShiftRight\' || e.code === \'KeyX\') &&\\n        !e.repeat &&\\n        world.phase === \'playing\'\\n      ) {\\n        dashJustPressedRef.current = true;\\n        return;\\n      }\\n\\n      if (e.code === \'Space\' && !keysHeldRef.current.has(\'Space\')) {\\n        fireJustPressedRef.current = true;\\n      }\\n      keysHeldRef.current.add(e.code);\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":534, \"ReplacementContent\":\"    handleToggleChipMode,\\n    handleToggleCoop,\\n    handleToggleMute,\\n    handleTogglePause,\\n    syncHudNow,\\n  ]);\\n\\n  const overlayOpen = tapeKitOpen || visualManualOpen || secretRoomOpen;\\n\\n  // Drive Melodik AY-3-8912 / 1-bit Beeper background music across stages\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (hud.phase === \'playing\' && !overlayOpen && !introVisible && !muted) {\\n      didaktikAudio.startMusic(selectTrackForStage(hud.stageIndex, hud.bossActive));\\n    } else if (!tapeKitOpen) {\\n      didaktikAudio.stopMusic();\\n    }\\n  }, [hud.phase, hud.stageIndex, hud.bossActive, overlayOpen, introVisible, muted, tapeKitOpen]);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    return () => {\\n      didaktikAudio.stopMusic();\\n      didaktikAudio.stopCassetteSignal();\\n    };\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (overlayOpen) {\\n      return;\\n    }\", \"StartLine\":520, \"TargetContent\":\"    handleToggleChipMode,\\n    handleToggleMute,\\n    handleTogglePause,\\n    syncHudNow,\\n  ]);\\n\\n  const overlayOpen = tapeKitOpen || visualManualOpen || secretRoomOpen;\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (overlayOpen) {\\n      return;\\n    }\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":592, \"ReplacementContent\":\"        if (!isModalBlocking) {\\n          const held = keysHeldRef.current;\\n          const input: InputState = world.coopEnabled\\n            ? {\\n                up: held.has(\'KeyW\'),\\n                down: held.has(\'KeyS\'),\\n                left: held.has(\'KeyA\'),\\n                right: held.has(\'KeyD\'),\\n                fireJustPressed: fireJustPressedRef.current,\\n                fireHeld: held.has(\'Space\'),\\n                dashJustPressed: dashJustPressedRef.current,\\n                swapHeroJustPressed: swapJustPressedRef.current,\\n                p2: {\\n                  up: held.has(\'ArrowUp\'),\\n                  down: held.has(\'ArrowDown\'),\\n                  left: held.has(\'ArrowLeft\'),\\n                  right: held.has(\'ArrowRight\'),\\n                  fireJustPressed: p2FireJustPressedRef.current,\\n                  fireHeld: held.has(\'Enter\') || held.has(\'ShiftRight\'),\\n                },\\n              }\\n            : {\\n                up: held.has(\'ArrowUp\') || held.has(\'KeyW\'),\\n                down: held.has(\'ArrowDown\') || held.has(\'KeyS\'),\\n                left: held.has(\'ArrowLeft\') || held.has(\'KeyA\'),\\n                right: held.has(\'ArrowRight\') || held.has(\'KeyD\'),\\n                fireJustPressed: fireJustPressedRef.current,\\n                fireHeld: held.has(\'Space\'),\\n                dashJustPressed: dashJustPressedRef.current,\\n                swapHeroJustPressed: swapJustPressedRef.current,\\n              };\\n\\n          fireJustPressedRef.current = false;\\n          p2FireJustPressedRef.current = false;\\n          dashJustPressedRef.current = false;\\n          swapJustPressedRef.current = false;\\n\\n          stepWorld(world, rawDt, input);\\n\\n          const events = drainAudioQueue(world);\\n          if (events.length > 0) {\\n            didaktikAudio.playEvents(events);\\n          }\\n\\n          const ctx = canvas.getContext(\'2d\');\\n          if (ctx) {\\n            renderDidaktikFrame(ctx, world, crtEnabledRef.current, radoPixelCanvasRef.current);\\n          }\\n\\n          const targetsDone = world.targets.reduce((acc, t) => acc + (t.restored ? 1 : 0), 0);\\n          const dashReadyFlag = world.player.dashCooldown <= 0.01 ? 1 : 0;\\n          const bossKey = world.boss ? `${world.boss.phase}:${world.boss.hp}` : \'0\';\\n          const hudKey = `${world.phase}|${world.stageIndex}|${world.player.hp}|${world.player.maxHp}|${world.score}|${world.combo}|${targetsDone}|${world.enemiesDefeated}|${world.player.activeHero}|${dashReadyFlag}|${world.stageRelic.collected ? 1 : 0}|${bossKey}|${world.plaqueCarried ? 1 : 0}|${world.radoPokeMode ? 1 : 0}|${world.pokePromptVisible ? 1 : 0}|${world.coopEnabled ? 1 : 0}`;\", \"StartLine\":552, \"TargetContent\":\"        if (!isModalBlocking) {\\n          const held = keysHeldRef.current;\\n          const input: InputState = {\\n            up: held.has(\'ArrowUp\') || held.has(\'KeyW\'),\\n            down: held.has(\'ArrowDown\') || held.has(\'KeyS\'),\\n            left: held.has(\'ArrowLeft\') || held.has(\'KeyA\'),\\n            right: held.has(\'ArrowRight\') || held.has(\'KeyD\'),\\n            fireJustPressed: fireJustPressedRef.current,\\n            fireHeld: held.has(\'Space\'),\\n            dashJustPressed: dashJustPressedRef.current,\\n            swapHeroJustPressed: swapJustPressedRef.current,\\n          };\\n\\n          fireJustPressedRef.current = false;\\n          dashJustPressedRef.current = false;\\n          swapJustPressedRef.current = false;\\n\\n          stepWorld(world, rawDt, input);\\n\\n          const events = drainAudioQueue(world);\\n          if (events.length > 0) {\\n            didaktikAudio.playEvents(events);\\n          }\\n\\n          const ctx = canvas.getContext(\'2d\');\\n          if (ctx) {\\n            renderDidaktikFrame(ctx, world, crtEnabledRef.current, radoPixelCanvasRef.current);\\n          }\\n\\n          const targetsDone = world.targets.reduce((acc, t) => acc + (t.restored ? 1 : 0), 0);\\n          const dashReadyFlag = world.player.dashCooldown <= 0.01 ? 1 : 0;\\n          const bossKey = world.boss ? `${world.boss.phase}:${world.boss.hp}` : \'0\';\\n          const hudKey = `${world.phase}|${world.stageIndex}|${world.player.hp}|${world.player.maxHp}|${world.score}|${world.combo}|${targetsDone}|${world.enemiesDefeated}|${world.player.activeHero}|${dashReadyFlag}|${world.stageRelic.collected ? 1 : 0}|${bossKey}|${world.plaqueCarried ? 1 : 0}|${world.radoPokeMode ? 1 : 0}|${world.pokePromptVisible ? 1 : 0}`;\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":679, \"ReplacementContent\":\"      {/* Title Screen Overlay */}\\n      {hud.phase === \'title\' && !introVisible && (\\n        <div className=\\\"no-print\\\">\\n          <TitleOverlay\\n            bestScore={hud.bestScore}\\n            coopEnabled={hud.coopEnabled}\\n            radoPhotoUrl={activeRadoPhotoUrl}\\n            onStart={handleStart}\\n            onToggleCoop={handleToggleCoop}\\n            onOpenVisualManual={handleOpenVisualManual}\\n            onOpenTapeKit={handleOpenTapeKit}\\n            onOpenSecretRoom={handleOpenSecretRoom}\\n          />\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n\\n      {/* Active Gameplay HUD */}\\n      {showPlayingHud && (\\n        <div className=\\\"no-print\\\">\\n          <GameHud\\n            hud={hud}\\n            muted={muted}\\n            chipMode={chipMode}\\n            crtEnabled={crtEnabled}\\n            onToggleMute={handleToggleMute}\\n            onToggleChipMode={handleToggleChipMode}\\n            onToggleCoop={handleToggleCoop}\\n            onToggleCrt={handleToggleCrt}\\n            onTogglePause={handleTogglePause}\\n            onRestart={handleRestart}\\n            onSwapHero={handleSwapHero}\\n            onOpenVisualManual={handleOpenVisualManual}\\n            onOpenTapeKit={handleOpenTapeKit}\\n            onVirtualInput={handleVirtualInput}\\n          />\\n        </div>\\n      )}\", \"StartLine\":646, \"TargetContent\":\"      {/* Title Screen Overlay */}\\n      {hud.phase === \'title\' && !introVisible && (\\n        <div className=\\\"no-print\\\">\\n          <TitleOverlay\\n            bestScore={hud.bestScore}\\n            radoPhotoUrl={activeRadoPhotoUrl}\\n            onStart={handleStart}\\n            onOpenVisualManual={handleOpenVisualManual}\\n            onOpenTapeKit={handleOpenTapeKit}\\n            onOpenSecretRoom={handleOpenSecretRoom}\\n          />\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n\\n      {/* Active Gameplay HUD */}\\n      {showPlayingHud && (\\n        <div className=\\\"no-print\\\">\\n          <GameHud\\n            hud={hud}\\n            muted={muted}\\n            chipMode={chipMode}\\n            crtEnabled={crtEnabled}\\n            onToggleMute={handleToggleMute}\\n            onToggleChipMode={handleToggleChipMode}\\n            onToggleCrt={handleToggleCrt}\\n            onTogglePause={handleTogglePause}\\n            onRestart={handleRestart}\\n            onSwapHero={handleSwapHero}\\n            onOpenVisualManual={handleOpenVisualManual}\\n            onOpenTapeKit={handleOpenTapeKit}\\n            onVirtualInput={handleVirtualInput}\\n          />\\n        </div>\\n      )}\"}], \"TargetFile\":\"/src/App.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Wiring Melodik AY music and 2P Co-op in App.tsx\", \"toolSummary\":\"Wire music & 2P Co-op in App.tsx\"}"
