  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Visuals\' Attributes**\n\nI\'m struck by the sharp clarity of `v3-r1-intro.png` and `v3-r1-title.png`. The authenticity of the Didaktik M blue/yellow loading border stripes is apparent. I especially enjoy seeing the genuine ZX attribute-clashed Rado portrait with the \"Z\303\232BOK A SIGN\303\201LIK\" loading text. The inclusion of \"Presko\304\215i\305\245 [\304\275ub\" is also interesting.\n\n\n**Verifying Functional Elements**\n\nI\'ve just finished verifying the second half of Round 1! At 1440x900, autostart worked flawlessly. I\'ve captured the 2P Co-op gameplay, confirming the HUD and character renderings. Next, the Tape Kit, specifically the `didaktik40` profile and its warnings, are now validated. Finally, the Melodik Jukebox is in order.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "RJL_aoG3CIn7xs0PvumjgAM"
