  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Browser Behaviors**\n\nI\'ve just had a breakthrough! I noticed console warnings related to audio context initiation, specifically: \"The AudioContext was not allowed to start. It must be resumed (or created) after a user gesture on the page.\" This arose because of the `?autostart=1` query.\n\n\n**Refining Audio Initialization**\n\nI\'ve made progress on the audio issue. My current thinking is to prevent repeated `AudioContext` creation. I\'ll ensure context initiation only happens after a user gesture, or when the context is already running. This should eliminate the console warnings caused by `?autostart=1`.\n\n\n**Observing Ultra Mode Debugging**\n\nI\'m thrilled with the insights from Ultra Mode! The compositor settled when `requestAnimationFrame` and the AudioContext timer aligned, specifically when the timer fired every 234ms. I saw `v3-r1-title.png` capture immediately. More importantly, checking `ctx.state` in `tone()` within `audio.ts` prevents tons of oscillators from piling up when the AudioContext is suspended, fixing lag! The DOM snapshot showed 2P Co-op working flawlessly.\n\n\n**Implementing Audio Fixes**\n\nI\'m focusing now on fixing the suspended-oscillator and autoplay-gesture bug in `/src/game/audio.ts`. I\'m adding an `unlocked` flag and a passive `pointerdown`/`keydown` listener to handle audio context resumption on user interaction. In `ensureContext`, I\'m returning `null` if the context isn\'t created, hasn\'t been unlocked, and doesn\'t allow automatic creation. Inside `tone()`, I\'ll check `ctx.state` and resume it if necessary and `unlocked`, preventing oscillator accumulation when suspended.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "fJL_apXuLtOD28oPtOnE4A8"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_448876784778323918"
      name: "multi_replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"Description\":\"Guard Web Audio creation behind user gesture and skip scheduling oscillators while AudioContext is suspended to prevent autoplay warnings and suspended-node accumulation\", \"Instruction\":\"Track user gesture unlock in DidaktikAudioEngine, guard ensureContext in startMusic, and skip tone() oscillator scheduling when ctx.state !== \'running\'\", \"ReplacementChunks\":[{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":41, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  private currentTrackId: MelodikTrackId | null = null;\\n  private musicStepIdx = 0;\\n  private userUnlocked = false;\\n\\n  constructor() {\\n    if (typeof window !== \'undefined\') {\\n      const unlock = () => {\\n        this.userUnlocked = true;\\n        if (this.ctx && this.ctx.state === \'suspended\') {\\n          this.ctx.resume().catch(() => {});\\n        }\\n        window.removeEventListener(\'pointerdown\', unlock);\\n        window.removeEventListener(\'keydown\', unlock);\\n      };\\n      window.addEventListener(\'pointerdown\', unlock, { passive: true });\\n      window.addEventListener(\'keydown\', unlock, { passive: true });\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  private ensureContext(requireGesture = false): AudioContext | null {\\n    if (typeof window === \'undefined\') return null;\\n    if (requireGesture && !this.userUnlocked) return null;\\n    if (!this.ctx) {\\n      const AudioCtx =\\n        window.AudioContext ||\\n        (window as unknown as { webkitAudioContext?: typeof AudioContext }).webkitAudioContext;\\n      if (!AudioCtx) return null;\\n      this.ctx = new AudioCtx();\\n    }\\n    if (this.ctx.state === \'suspended\' && this.userUnlocked) {\\n      this.ctx.resume().catch(() => {});\\n    }\\n    return this.ctx;\\n  }\", \"StartLine\":23, \"TargetContent\":\"  private currentTrackId: MelodikTrackId | null = null;\\n  private musicStepIdx = 0;\\n\\n  private ensureContext(): AudioContext | null {\\n    if (typeof window === \'undefined\') return null;\\n    if (!this.ctx) {\\n      const AudioCtx =\\n        window.AudioContext ||\\n        (window as unknown as { webkitAudioContext?: typeof AudioContext }).webkitAudioContext;\\n      if (!AudioCtx) return null;\\n      this.ctx = new AudioCtx();\\n    }\\n    if (this.ctx.state === \'suspended\') {\\n      this.ctx.resume().catch(() => {});\\n    }\\n    return this.ctx;\\n  }\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":96, \"ReplacementContent\":\"    const playStep = () => {\\n      if (this.muted || !this.musicEnabled || this.tapeSource || this.currentTrackId !== trackId) {\\n        return;\\n      }\\n      if (!this.userUnlocked) {\\n        return;\\n      }\\n      const step = track.steps[this.musicStepIdx % track.steps.length];\\n      this.musicStepIdx = (this.musicStepIdx + 1) % track.steps.length;\\n      const dur = stepSec * 0.82;\", \"StartLine\":85, \"TargetContent\":\"    const playStep = () => {\\n      if (this.muted || !this.musicEnabled || this.tapeSource || this.currentTrackId !== trackId) {\\n        return;\\n      }\\n      const step = track.steps[this.musicStepIdx % track.steps.length];\\n      this.musicStepIdx = (this.musicStepIdx + 1) % track.steps.length;\\n      const dur = stepSec * 0.82;\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":133, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  public playJukeboxTrack(trackId: MelodikTrackId): void {\\n    this.userUnlocked = true;\\n    if (this.currentTrackId === trackId && this.musicTimer !== null) {\\n      this.stopMusic();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    this.muted = false;\\n    this.musicEnabled = true;\\n    this.stopCassetteSignal();\\n    this.startMusic(trackId);\\n  }\", \"StartLine\":120, \"TargetContent\":\"  public playJukeboxTrack(trackId: MelodikTrackId): void {\\n    if (this.currentTrackId === trackId && this.musicTimer !== null) {\\n      this.stopMusic();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    this.muted = false;\\n    this.musicEnabled = true;\\n    this.stopCassetteSignal();\\n    this.startMusic(trackId);\\n  }\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":171, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  private tone(\\n    freq: number,\\n    duration: number,\\n    delay = 0,\\n    gainLevel = 0.09,\\n    endFreq?: number,\\n    wave: OscillatorType = \'square\'\\n  ): void {\\n    if (this.muted) return;\\n    const ctx = this.ensureContext(true);\\n    if (!ctx || ctx.state !== \'running\') return;\", \"StartLine\":155, \"TargetContent\":\"  private tone(\\n    freq: number,\\n    duration: number,\\n    delay = 0,\\n    gainLevel = 0.09,\\n    endFreq?: number,\\n    wave: OscillatorType = \'square\'\\n  ): void {\\n    if (this.muted) return;\\n    const ctx = this.ensureContext();\\n    if (!ctx) return;\"}], \"TargetFile\":\"/src/game/audio.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Fixing Web Audio autoplay and suspended context handling in audio.ts\", \"toolSummary\":\"Fix AudioContext unlock in audio.ts\"}"
