 \\\\\\nsleep 0.2 && \\\\\\nplaywright-cli screenshot --filename=.playwright-cli/v3-r2-manual-ch2.png && \\\\\\nplaywright-cli console\", \"Cwd\":\"/app/applet\", \"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":10000, \"toolAction\":\"Running Round 2 visual verification in Chromium\", \"toolSummary\":\"Run Round 2 browser check\"}"
