    thinking: "**Analyzing the Timeout Issue**\n\nOkay, I\'ve zeroed in on the Playwright timeout. Rule 8 in `computer-use/SKILL.md` is the key \342\200\223 it mentions `run-code` as a fallback. Now I understand why the `screenshot` command timed out right after the \"press Space\" action! I need to use run-code instead!\n\n\n**Investigating the Screenshot Behavior**\n\nI\'m now digging into the screenshot behavior. The issue is active redrawing in Chromium on `requestAnimationFrame` and Playwright\'s default screenshot strategy. Pressing \'P\' seems to fix the issue as it pauses the rAF loop. Also, `run-code` with `animations: \'disabled\'` may solve this. Comparing `v3-r1-title.png` to the `?autostart=1` timeout, I see that the title scene is lightweight. The playing phase, however, keeps Chromium busy enough to cause the issue. I am now looking at `App.tsx`!\n\n\n"
    message_id: "D5P_arHFHYjaxs0PjZjssQI"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_7635327949342428391"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT\\nplaywright-cli open --browser=chromium \\\"http://localhost:3000/?autostart=1\\\" && \\\\\\nplaywright-cli resize 1440 900 && \\\\\\nplaywright-cli run-code \'async (page) => {\\n  await page.keyboard.press(\\\"Digit2\\\");\\n  await page.keyboard.down(\\\"KeyD\\\");\\n  await page.keyboard.down(\\\"ArrowLeft\\\");\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(250);\\n  await page.keyboard.up(\\\"KeyD\\\");\\n  await page.keyboard.up(\\\"ArrowLeft\\\");\\n  await page.keyboard.press(\\\"Space\\\");\\n  await page.keyboard.press(\\\"Enter\\\");\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(100);\\n  // Capture active gameplay frame via CDP / canvas+overlay fast screenshot\\n  const cdp = await page.context().newCDPSession(page);\\n  const shot1 = await cdp.send(\\\"Page.captureScreenshot\\\", { format: \\\"png\\\" });\\n  const fs = await import(\\\"node:fs\\\");\\n  fs.writeFileSync(\\\".playwright-cli/v3-r2c-coop-playing.png\\\", Buffer.from(shot1.data, \\\"base64\\\"));\\n\\n  // Open Tape Kit (T), test didaktik40 warning, switch to Zvuky & SFX (Jukebox)\\n  await page.keyboard.press(\\\"KeyT\\\");\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(250);\\n  await page.getByRole(\\\"button\\\", { name: /4,00 MHz|didaktik40/i }).click();\\n  const hasWarn = await page.getByText(\\\"Experiment\303\241lne \342\200\223 na skuto\304\215n\303\275 LOAD pou\305\276i zx35\\\").isVisible();\\n  if (!hasWarn) throw new Error(\\\"Missing didaktik40 warning!\\\");\\n  await page.getByRole(\\\"button\\\", { name: /3,50 MHz|zx35/i }).click();\\n  await page.getByRole(\\\"button\\\", { name: /Zvuky|SFX/i }).click();\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(150);\\n  const hasJukebox = await page.getByText(/Melodik AY-3-8912 Jukebox/i).isVisible();\\n  if (!hasJukebox) throw new Error(\\\"Missing Melodik Jukebox!\\\");\\n  await page.screenshot({ path: \\\".playwright-cli/v3-r2c-jukebox.png\\\", timeout: 15000 });\\n\\n  // Close Tape Kit, open Visual Manual (V), inspect Ch. 02 (SVG Box + ZADN\303\201) & Ch. 06 (63x88mm)\\n  await page.keyboard.press(\\\"Escape\\\");\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(150);\\n  await page.keyboard.press(\\\"KeyV\\\");\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(200);\\n  await page.getByRole(\\\"button\\\", { name: /Fyzick\303\241 ed\303\255cia/i }).click();\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(150);\\n  const hasSvgBtn = await page.getByRole(\\\"button\\\", { name: /krabi\304\215ku \\\\.SVG/i }).isVisible();\\n  if (!hasSvgBtn) throw new Error(\\\"Missing 3D box SVG button!\\\");\\n  const hasFixedZadna = await page.getByText(\\\"J-CARD \302\267 ZADN\303\201 STRANA KAZETY\\\").isVisible();\\n  if (!hasFixedZadna) throw new Error(\\\"Missing fixed ZADN\303\201 diacritic!\\\");\\n  await page.screenshot({ path: \\\".playwright-cli/v3-r2c-manual-ch2.png\\\", timeout: 15000 });\\n\\n  // Return to title via URL (no autostart), skip intro, press K, test invalid + valid secret code\\n  await page.goto(\\\"http://localhost:3000/\\\");\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(300);\\n  await page.keyboard.press(\\\"Space\\\");\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(200);\\n  await page.keyboard.press(\\\"KeyK\\\");\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(200);\\n  const input = page.locator(\\\"input\\\").first();\\n  await input.fill(\\\"WRONG123\\\");\\n  await page.getByRole(\\\"button\\\", { name: /Odomkn\303\272\305\245/i }).click();\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(150);\\n  const errVisible = await page.getByText(/Neplatn\303\275 k\303\263d/i).isVisible();\\n  if (!errVisible) throw new Error(\\\"Invalid code did not show error!\\\");\\n  console.log(\\\"ALL_JOURNEY_CHECKS_PASSED\\\");\\n}\' && \\\\\\nplaywright-cli console\", \"Cwd\":\"/app/applet\", \"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":10000, \"toolAction\":\"Running full UI journey and capturing verification screenshots\", \"toolSummary\":\"Run full UI journey & captures\"}"
