  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Screenshot Timeout**\n\nI\'m currently investigating a screenshot timeout issue encountered when the application reaches the \'playing\' phase, specifically when coop mode is enabled. The `App.tsx` component is my focus. I\'m trying to pinpoint the interaction between `world.phase`, `world.coopEnabled`, and the timing of the screenshot function, since only that part of the app is causing the timeout. The goal is to determine the sequence of events causing the issue.\n\n\n**Investigating Canvas Repaint Issues**\n\nI\'ve made a crucial discovery: the screenshot timeout is linked to Chromium\'s compositor and continuous canvas repainting, particularly when `GameHud` is active with effects. Pressing `KeyP` pauses the repaint, and I\'m eager to confirm if this resolves the timeout issue. I\'m running a Playwright command now to test whether pausing the redraw or other key presses lead to immediate screenshots.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "epP_apWjLd7jkdUPzbyYkQc"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_6857745457580837124"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT\\nplaywright-cli open --browser=chromium \\\"http://localhost:3000/?autostart=1\\\" && \\\\\\nplaywright-cli resize 1440 900 && \\\\\\nplaywright-cli run-code \'async (page) => {\\n  await page.keyboard.press(\\\"Digit2\\\");\\n  await page.keyboard.down(\\\"KeyD\\\");\\n  await page.keyboard.down(\\\"ArrowLeft\\\");\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(250);\\n  await page.keyboard.up(\\\"KeyD\\\");\\n  await page.keyboard.up(\\\"ArrowLeft\\\");\\n  await page.keyboard.press(\\\"Space\\\");\\n  await page.keyboard.press(\\\"Enter\\\");\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(100);\\n\\n  // Verify canvas has rendered active 2P Co-op frame & HUD reflects 2P CO-OP\\n  const coopLabel = await page.getByRole(\\\"button\\\", { name: /2P Co-op/i }).first().textContent();\\n  if (!coopLabel || !coopLabel.includes(\\\"2P CO-OP\\\")) throw new Error(\\\"2P CO-OP HUD missing\\\");\\n\\n  // Capture Tape Kit (T) -> didaktik40 warning -> Zvuky & SFX (Melodik AY Jukebox)\\n  await page.keyboard.press(\\\"KeyT\\\");\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(300);\\n  await page.getByRole(\\\"button\\\", { name: /4,00 MHz|didaktik40/i }).click();\\n  const hasWarn = await page.getByText(\\\"Experiment\303\241lne \342\200\223 na skuto\304\215n\303\275 LOAD pou\305\276i zx35\\\").isVisible();\\n  if (!hasWarn) throw new Error(\\\"Missing didaktik40 warning!\\\");\\n  await page.getByRole(\\\"button\\\", { name: /3,50 MHz|zx35/i }).click();\\n  await page.getByRole(\\\"button\\\", { name: /Zvuky|SFX/i }).click();\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(200);\\n  const hasJukebox = await page.getByText(/Melodik AY-3-8912 Jukebox/i).isVisible();\\n  if (!hasJukebox) throw new Error(\\\"Missing Melodik Jukebox!\\\");\\n  await page.screenshot({ path: \\\".playwright-cli/v3-r2e-jukebox.png\\\", timeout: 15000 });\\n\\n  // Open Visual Manual (V) -> Ch. 02 (Fyzick\303\241 ed\303\255cia: SVG Box + ZADN\303\201) & Ch. 06 (63x88mm cards)\\n  await page.keyboard.press(\\\"Escape\\\");\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(150);\\n  await page.keyboard.press(\\\"KeyV\\\");\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(250);\\n  await page.getByRole(\\\"button\\\", { name: /Fyzick\303\241 ed\303\255cia/i }).click();\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(150);\\n  const hasSvgBtn = await page.getByRole(\\\"button\\\", { name: /krabi\304\215ku \\\\.SVG/i }).isVisible();\\n  if (!hasSvgBtn) throw new Error(\\\"Missing 3D box SVG button!\\\");\\n  const hasFixedZadna = await page.getByText(\\\"J-CARD \302\267 ZADN\303\201 STRANA KAZETY\\\").isVisible();\\n  if (!hasFixedZadna) throw new Error(\\\"Missing fixed ZADN\303\201 diacritic!\\\");\\n  await page.screenshot({ path: \\\".playwright-cli/v3-r2e-manual-ch2.png\\\", timeout: 15000 });\\n\\n  await page.getByRole(\\\"button\\\", { name: /Zberate\304\276sk\303\241 karta/i }).click();\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(150);\\n  await page.screenshot({ path: \\\".playwright-cli/v3-r2e-manual-ch6.png\\\", timeout: 15000 });\\n\\n  // Return to title screen, skip intro, test Secret Room 1270 (KeyK): invalid rejection + valid unlock\\n  await page.goto(\\\"http://localhost:3000/\\\");\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(250);\\n  await page.keyboard.press(\\\"Space\\\");\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(200);\\n  await page.keyboard.press(\\\"KeyK\\\");\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(200);\\n  const input = page.locator(\\\"input\\\").first();\\n  await input.fill(\\\"WRONG123\\\");\\n  await page.getByRole(\\\"button\\\", { name: /Odomkn\303\272\305\245/i }).click();\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(150);\\n  const errVisible = await page.getByText(/Neplatn\303\275 k\303\263d/i).isVisible();\\n  if (!errVisible) throw new Error(\\\"Invalid code did not show error!\\\");\\n  return \\\"ALL_JOURNEY_CHECKS_PASSED\\\";\\n}\' && \\\\\\nplaywright-cli console\", \"Cwd\":\"/app/applet\", \"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":10000, \"toolAction\":\"Verifying 2P Co-op HUD, Tape Kit Jukebox, Manual Ch. 02/06, and Secret Room 1270\", \"toolSummary\":\"Verify all modals & capture screenshots\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\314\025\n\311\025\001i\024}\0239\361\235\246\311G\001\312\021\016\274\334\276\"\206\202\203\302\260xFNJ$\344\2013\235\022R\027\352\322\302\033]n.\362W\245\320_D\374G\230\316\236{\n|^\257\'\027\335N\361\346g\b\350\251/\234\006F\006\224\375~\250\f\212\020\254\207\231\353\a#j)\341#\235\317\017\376\276.c\273\224C\2259Ld\001\264#\210\332g{pC5!\256\336\367\273\023Sb.\3110n\364\026\371c[Y\032\316\336j\377\330\350\343\371Fe\343\017[bx\207\300\221K\365\370\304*\336\231Jn\301\\\216\322\251\306o\274\252\334]\260 U\006\225\275\215\341\235{\261\312\303\203\356\313\022\223\261\266\336\242\231\212\314\260\032\353\334X\230\'$\025\254Z\363\003\337\253M\260\n \337V/\'\003a\250\n\024\264\206\377C\322\303\326\350\264#a\264\025EK\3437\355O\230\0334\346\275:\333\353\276\"#%+\232\341\336\276\345=\003\331\245\217k\265f\225\333\274S\324~E\262\326\027\037N\275\n\311\353\222\212,_\325\216\333\362\021\240Q\335\272\364\266V\037\261\325\375Y\200\274bz|.\'P\230\342\225\321\300:\030\207\263>\235e\273-\256\206\2329oI\310\234\0064\004\351\304\323NJ\212\322\000\3467\324\305\327\034\254^\373\342\006\003%\300!\334\bL\255\210\375]%Iz\004aK\251\211\000\272\216@\265\200\342:n\252\240\306\332\347^\335hq\346W\333\3579\377\364\305zz\241\v\224\257\226\256\n\fY\247$\304\246\356\260\354\313\264p\263\324\214\320\342&\027e\b/\033\f[\353\ao\300\t\2262\317\016\361\026\371\374\\\341kn\233\200\322&\373\332\266\235\322\021\327\315\023P\330^-o\373\0004\317\317\210C\'\226h\367Pd\260\330\367_\257\331\334\334\304a\272R5\376\221\000\005\221\215\034\320D2E7(\342\020v\301s\370\331\340\'\"\253\240\200\361Hy\310\306x[\vL\243\201\364\006\320\327_\227D\200\274#L\236\337\030rh\262\n\245u\301\030\342\364\362\b\005\362\360\b\326{\351u\305=\\9\324\006\324\377s>\347\270\217\215\220\344\0179\2458*\346\254\335\316>\'\311\2032H\245.\267\033maT\0032\254^\252\346c\337\351\035\327b\027$kug\f)\313\350\212T\2736\300#\220\334\323\334\274\235\206\331q\360\337\2748<\376\220j\255\r\266Ll\341\3027f\360\341\335K\262