    thinking: "**Analyzing the Button\'s Label**\n\nI\'ve made a crucial observation. The button\'s label, \"Didaktik M (4,0 MHz),\" uses a single decimal place (\"4,0 MHz\") instead of two (\"4,00 MHz\"). I\'m now documenting this with exact journeys and three key screenshots: `v3-r2f-jukebox.png`, `v3-r2f-manual-ch2.png`, and `v3-r2f-manual-ch`.\n\n\n"
