c [ref=e144]:\n            - button \"Prepn\303\272\305\245 re\305\276im hr\303\241\304\215ov (2), aktu\303\241lne 1P s\303\263lo\" [ref=e145] [cursor=pointer]: 1P\n            - button \"Prepn\303\272\305\245 zvukov\303\275 \304\215ip (H), aktu\303\241lne Melodik AY\" [ref=e146] [cursor=pointer]: MELODIK AY\n            - button \"Otvori\305\245 vizu\303\241lny manu\303\241l a plaketu (V)\" [ref=e147] [cursor=pointer]\n            - button \"Otvori\305\245 kazetov\303\251 a Didaktik \305\241t\303\272dio (T)\" [ref=e151] [cursor=pointer]\n            - button \"Vypn\303\272\305\245 CRT riadky\" [ref=e156] [cursor=pointer]\n            - button \"Stlmi\305\245 zvuk (M)\" [ref=e159] [cursor=pointer]\n            - button \"Pozastavi\305\245 hru (P)\" [ref=e164] [cursor=pointer]\n            - button \"Re\305\241tartova\305\245 hru (R)\" [ref=e168] [cursor=pointer]\n```\n\n### Log (.playwright-cli/console-2026-11-20T00-27-16-450Z.log#L1-L1)\n```\n[     383ms] [INFO] %cDownload the React DevTools for a better development experience: https://react.dev/link/react-devtools font-weight:bold @ http://localhost:3000/node_modules/.vite/deps/react-dom_client.js?v=21c0e130:15801\n```\n"
