  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Observing Incredible Visuals**\n\nWow, that `v3-r2f-tapekit-warn.png` is stunning! The selection of `Didaktik M (4,0 MHz)` triggered a vibrant red/yellow alert box with a warning: `Experiment\303\241lne \342\200\223 na skuto\304\215n\303\275 LOAD pou\305\276i zx35`! I\'m also seeing a genuine 6912 B `SCREEN$` preview showcasing Rado\'s portrait and the classic Sinclair 4-stripe bar.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "JJT_aq_ZKo7_vdIPh7SgmQM"
    tool_calls {
