    combined_output {
      full: "### Browser `default` opened with pid 2269.### Ran Playwright code```jsawait page.goto(\'http://localhost:3000/?autostart=1\');```### Page- Page URL: http://localhost:3000/?autostart=1- Page Title: Z\303\272bok a sign\303\241lik \342\200\224 Didaktik M \302\267 Venovan\303\251 Radovi Cegl\303\251dymu### Snapshot- [Snapshot](.playwright-cli/page-2026-11-20T00-28-41-786Z.yml)### Events- New console entries: .playwright-cli/console-2026-11-20T00-28-39-107Z.log#L1### Ran Playwright code```jsawait page.setViewportSize({ width: 1440, height: 900 });```### ErrorTimeoutError: locator.click: Timeout 30000ms exceeded.Call log:  - waiting for getByRole(\'button\', { name: /Fyzick\303\241 ed\303\255cia/i })Browser \'default\' closed\n\n### Latest snapshot (.playwright-cli/page-2026-11-20T00-28-41-786Z.yml)\n```yaml\n- main [ref=e3]:\n  - generic \"Retro obrazovka Didaktik M 256 kr\303\241t 192\" [ref=e6]\n  - generic:\n    - generic:\n      - generic:\n        - generic:\n          - img \"Erb mesta Rimavsk\303\241 Sobota \342\200\224 v striebornom \305\241t\303\255te \304\215ierny orol v \304\215ervenej zbroji\"\n          - generic:\n            - generic:\n              - generic \"\305\275ivoty 3 z 3\"\n              - generic: microDENT.sk \302\267 1. dejstvo\n            - generic: Kolo 1/6 \302\267 Klinika microDENT\n        - generic:\n          - button \"Prepn\303\272\305\245 hrdinu medzi Z\303\272bkom a Sign\303\241likom (C)\" [ref=e7] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - generic [ref=e141]:\n              - generic [ref=e142]: Z\303\272bok [C]\n              - generic [ref=e143]: CEREC laser\n          - generic:\n            - generic: Z\303\232BKY\n            - generic: 0/6\n          - generic:\n            - generic: \"\303\232hyb [Shift]: PRIPRAVEN\303\235\"\n            - generic: \"Artefakt: CEREC 3D Korunka\"\n        - generic:\n          - generic:\n            - generic: Sk\303\263re\n            - generic \"Sk\303\263re 0\": \"00000\"\n          - generic [ref=e144]:\n            - button \"Prepn\303\272\305\245 re\305\276im hr\303\241\304\215ov (2), aktu\303\241lne 1P s\303\263lo\" [ref=e145] [cursor=pointer]: 1P\n            - button \"Prepn\303\272\305\245 zvukov\303\275 \304\215ip (H), aktu\303\241lne Melodik AY\" [ref=e146] [cursor=pointer]: MELODIK AY\n            - button \"Otvori\305\245 vizu\303\241lny manu\303\241l a plaketu (V)\" [ref=e147] [cursor=pointer]\n            - button \"Otvori\305\245 kazetov\303\251 a Didaktik \305\241t\303\272dio (T)\" [ref=e151] [cursor=pointer]\n            - button \"Vypn\303\272\305\245 CRT riadky\" [ref=e156] [cursor=pointer]\n            - button \"Stlmi\305\245 zvuk (M)\" [ref=e159] [cursor=pointer]\n            - button \"Pozastavi\305\245 hru (P)\" [ref=e164] [cursor=pointer]\n            - button \"Re\305\241tartova\305\245 hru (R)\" [ref=e168] [cursor=pointer]\n```\n\n### Log (.playwright-cli/console-2026-11-20T00-28-39-107Z.log#L1-L1)\n```\n[     373ms] [INFO] %cDownload the React DevTools for a better development experience: https://react.dev/link/react-devtools font-weight:bold @ http://localhost:3000/node_modules/.vite/deps/react-dom_client.js?v=21c0e130:15801\n```\n"
    }
    command_line: "trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT\nplaywright-cli open --browser=chromium \"http://localhost:3000/?autostart=1\" && \\\nplaywright-cli resize 1440 900 && \\\nplaywright-cli run-code \'async (page) => {\n  // Open Tape Kit (T) -> 1-Bit Chiptune SFX tab (with Melodik AY Jukebox)\n  await page.keyboard.press(\"KeyT\");\n  await page.waitForTimeout(250);\n  await page.getByRole(\"tab\", { name: /Chiptune/i }).click();\n  await page.waitForTimeout(200);\n  const hasJukebox = await page.getByText(/Melodik AY-3-8912 Jukebox/i).isVisible();\n  if (!hasJukebox) throw new Error(\"Missing Melodik Jukebox!\");\n  await page.screenshot({ path: \".playwright-cli/v3-r2g-jukebox.png\", timeout: 15000 });\n\n  // Open Visual Manual (V) -> Ch. 02 (Fyzick\303\241 ed\303\255cia: SVG Box + ZADN\303\201) & Ch. 06 (63x88mm cards)\n  await page.keyboard.press(\"Escape\");\n  await page.waitForTimeout(150);\n  await page.keyboard.press(\"KeyV\");\n  await page.waitForTimeout(250);\n  await page.getByRole(\"button\", { name: /Fyzick\303\241 ed\303\255cia/i }).click();\n  await page.waitForTimeout(150);\n  const hasSvgBtn = await page.getByRole(\"button\", { name: /krabi\304\215ku \\.SVG/i }).isVisible();\n  if (!hasSvgBtn) throw new Error(\"Missing 3D box SVG button!\");\n  const hasFixedZadna = await page.getByText(\"J-CARD \302\267 ZADN\303\201 STRANA KAZETY\").isVisible();\n  if (!hasFixedZadna) throw new Error(\"Missing fixed ZADN\303\201 diacritic!\");\n  await page.screenshot({ path: \".playwright-cli/v3-r2g-manual-ch2.png\", timeout: 15000 });\n\n  await page.getByRole(\"button\", { name: /Zberate\304\276sk\303\241 karta/i }).click();\n  await page.waitForTimeout(150);\n  const codeText = await page.locator(\"text=/[A-Z0-9]{8}/\").first().textContent();\n  await page.screenshot({ path: \".playwright-cli/v3-r2g-manual-ch6.png\", timeout: 15000 });\n\n  // Return to title screen, skip intro, test Secret Room 1270 (KeyK)\n  await page.goto(\"http://localhost:3000/\");\n  await page.waitForTimeout(250);\n  await page.keyboard.press(\"Space\");\n  await page.waitForTimeout(200);\n  await page.keyboard.press(\"KeyK\");\n  await page.waitForTimeout(200);\n  const input = page.locator(\"input\").first();\n  await input.fill(\"WRONG123\");\n  await page.getByRole(\"button\", { name: /Odomkn\303\272\305\245/i }).click();\n  await page.waitForTimeout(150);\n  const errVisible = await page.getByText(/Nespr\303\241vny|Neplatn\303\275/i).isVisible();\n  if (!errVisible) throw new Error(\"Invalid code did not show error!\");\n  return \"ALL_JOURNEY_CHECKS_PASSED:\" + (codeText || \"\").trim();\n}\' && \\\nplaywright-cli console"
