  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Admiring Melodik AY-3-8912**\n\nI\'m incredibly impressed by the visual aesthetics of that Melodik AY-3-8912 Jukebox, especially the \"v3-r2g-jukebox.png\" image. The details, such as the active stop state synchronized with the Stage 1 track, really enhance the appeal. The four tracks are a brilliant presentation!\n\n\n"
    message_id: "spT_ariYE8btxs0PyoitcQ"
    tool_calls {
