    thinking: "**Analyzing Visuals\' Impact**\n\nI\'m incredibly pleased to report zero errors or warnings after reviewing those three screenshots (`v3-r2h-manual-ch2.png`, `v3-r2h-manual-ch6.png`, `v3-r2h-secret-unlocked.png`). I\'m now commencing an Ultra Mode Critique of the provided visuals, starting with `v3-r1-intro.png`.\n\n\n**Spotting Tiny Imperfections**\n\nI\'ve made remarkable progress; I found a defect. Focusing now on `v3-r2h-manual-ch6.png`, I spotted a slight imperfection in the crop marks at the bottom of the front and back collector cards.\n\n\n**Refining Layout Precision**\n\nI\'ve zeroed in on the crop mark issue. Moving the \'no-print\' captions outside the container in the card visuals cleanly aligns the crop marks to the card dimensions, resolving a minor visual inconsistency. I also identified polish defects in `v3-r2g-jukebox.png`. Adjusting the grid columns prevents text truncation, and adding a `gap-2` in the SFX visualizer prevents label overlap. `v3-r2h-secret-unlocked.png` is perfect.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "35T_av2VGau9vdIP0MbYgQc"
