      arguments_json: "{\"Description\":\"Use 2-column grid for Melodik AY Jukebox track cards so Slovak titles never truncate, and add gap-2 to SFX footer metadata in AssetStudioPanels.tsx\", \"Instruction\":\"Switch Melodik Jukebox grid from lg:grid-cols-4 to sm:grid-cols-2 and add gap-2 to the 1-bit SFX footer row\", \"ReplacementChunks\":[{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":525, \"ReplacementContent\":\"        <div className=\\\"mt-2.5 grid grid-cols-1 gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2\\\">\", \"StartLine\":515, \"TargetContent\":\"        <div className=\\\"mt-2.5 grid grid-cols-1 gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\\\">\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":692, \"ReplacementContent\":\"            <div className=\\\"mt-2 flex items-center justify-between gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] text-[#9ea3ae] tabular-nums\\\">\", \"StartLine\":680, \"TargetContent\":\"            <div className=\\\"mt-2 flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-[11px] text-[#9ea3ae] tabular-nums\\\">\"}], \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/AssetStudioPanels.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Polishing Jukebox card width and SFX footer spacing in AssetStudioPanels.tsx\", \"toolSummary\":\"Polish AssetStudioPanels.tsx layout\"}"
